  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Front Line Defenders 2020-2022/ 2023-2025 - FLD 2020-2022/2023-2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Front Line Defenders 2020-2022/ 2023-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Front Line Defenders provides direct practical support for HRDs that is based directly on their articulated needs - including emergency funding. Front Line Defenders has a four year Strategic Plan covering the period 2019-2022 with the below presented four strategic goals / objectives, which interlink with Front Line Defenders&apos; Theory of Change.&#xa0;
The expected result on impact level&#xa0;for the intervention is: Human Right Defenders (HRDs) at the local and national level enjoy the freedom and security to undertake their legitimate activities.&#xa0;The expected&#xa0;result on outcome level is:&#xa0;Stronger&#xa0;international&#xa0;protection for&#xa0;human rights&#xa0;defenders to enable&#xa0;them to better&#xa0;manage their&#xa0;security and carry&#xa0;out their legitimate&#xa0;work - more HRDs&#xa0;at risk have&#xa0;received positive&#xa0;benefit of support&#xa0;for their legitimate&#xa0;work.&#xa0;The correlated 4 strategic&#xa0;objectives&#xa0;are:
(1) Provide fast, flexible and effective 24-hour emergency response that responds to the protection needs of HRDs at immediate risk;
(2) Strengthen the resilience and capacity of HRDs to manage their security and protection;
(3) Enhance the visibility of HRDs and the positive impact of their work;
(4) Strengthen national, regional and international protection of HRDs at risk.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen avser ett k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till organisationen Front Line Defenders under perioden 2020-2022. F&#xf6;r denna period ska Front Line Defenders genomf&#xf6;ra sin strategiska plan med fokus p&#xe5; f&#xf6;ljande omr&#xe5;den: 

1)Ge snabbt, flexibelt och effektivt 24-timmars akut- och n&#xf6;dst&#xf6;d i relation till skyddsbehoven hos utsatta m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttighetsf&#xf6;rsvarare.
2)St&#xe4;rka m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttighetsf&#xf6;rsvarares motst&#xe5;ndskraft och kapacitet att hantera sin s&#xe4;kerhet och sitt skydd.
3)F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra synligheten f&#xf6;r m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttighetsf&#xf6;rsvarare och de positiva effekterna av deras arbete.
4)St&#xe4;rka det nationella, regionala och internationella skyddet av utsatta m&#xe4;nniskor&#xe4;ttsf&#xf6;rsvarare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution is a core support to the organisation Front Line Defenders for implementing their Strategic Plan during the period 2020-2022.

The overall goal is to enable human rights defenders (HRDs) at the local and national level enjoy the freedom and security to undertake their legitimate activities. The correlated 4 strategic objectives for the Strategic Plan are:

(1) Provide fast, flexible and effective 24-hour emergency response that responds to the protection needs of HRDs at immediate risk;

(2) Strengthen the resilience and capacity of HRDs to manage their security and protection;

(3) Enhance the visibility of HRDs and the positive impact of their work;

(4) Strengthen national, regional and international protection of HRDs at risk.</narrative>
  </description>
